<title>JAPAN: Nihonbashi Ware -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nihonbashi Ware -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		855    million	  vs	  936    million</p>
<p> Operating		   nil		vs    loss 92    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 117    million	  vs   loss 217    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 118    million	  vs   loss 221    million</p>
<p> EPS		   loss 7.87 yen	  vs    loss 14.80 yen</p>
<p> Shares		   15 million	  vs	  15 million</p>
<p> Interim div			--	  vs		    --</p>
<p>NOTE - Nihonbashi Warehouse Co Ltd is a warehousing company handling textiles and electric machinery.</p>
</text>
